        "text": "[{\"x\":0.3163660448729221,\"y\":0.8867509694231288,\"text\":\"In Memory of A Late Classmate\",\"width\":0.41969177303511584,\"height\":0.023817307164692325},{\"x\":0.44234800879042746,\"y\":0.5872093025815028,\"text\":\"LUI WING TAT\",\"width\":0.16142557167491034,\"height\":0.013116430226677078},{\"x\":0.1907757017004736,\"y\":0.5348534202102337,\"text\":\"On the fourth day of the School Certificate Examination Lui Wing Tat was taken\",\"width\":0.7358490306032455,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.12368973181307166,\"y\":0.5174418601939712,\"text\":\"to hospital because he had a great fever. On the following day he passed away of blood\",\"width\":0.8029349929077493,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"x\":0.12578616622680752,\"y\":0.5013029313499482,\"text\":\"cancer. It was Sunday, May 24th. We were about to visit him when we were told that he\",\"width\":0.800838552997119,\"height\":0.01468544068476274},{\"x\":0.12578618569147773,\"y\":0.48401162809947973,\"text\":\"had already died. We could hardly believe it; it was so sudden. The memory of Ah Tat，\",\"width\":0.8029349929077493,\"height\":0.01598837165956768},{\"x\":0.1257861745214114,\"y\":0.47093023292307257,\"text\":\"as we used to call him, is still very vivid in our minds.\",\"width\":0.4947589002234243,\"height\":0.013108854884045118},{\"x\":0.19077570354009604,\"y\":0.43745928346773677,\"text\":\"As a young man of seventeen, Ah Tat had a very strong character. Once he had\",\"width\":0.7358490306032455,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.12578616437249607,\"y\":0.42149837111540034,\"text\":\"made up his mind he seldom gave in. He was honest, sincere, friendly, and gentle.\",\"width\":0.7484276700670274,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.8742138361200217,\"y\":0.42441860472647774,\"text\":\"One\",\"width\":0.05241090087316447,\"height\":0.010174418272335228},{\"x\":0.12578616864469716,\"y\":0.40552325602730455,\"text\":\"thing we can never forget is that he never let his friends down. He did his very best in\",\"width\":0.800838552997119,\"height\":0.01467218367983536},{\"x\":0.1257861657446273,\"y\":0.3879478825978159,\"text\":\"helping others. When he saw something wrong he always spoke out against it without\",\"width\":0.800838552997119,\"height\":0.014668396319162502},{\"x\":0.12340052052033508,\"y\":0.3715037721321177,\"text\":\"fear.\",\"width\":0.047833213913810776,\"height\":0.016066938269798436},{\"x\":0.16981133611130514,\"y\":0.3735465118412581,\"text\":\"He was very straightforward. We never heard him swear and he never grumbled.\",\"width\":0.7568133722917156,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"x\":0.12788262364120248,\"y\":0.35755813955443627,\"text\":\"He was humble, and always expressed disgust towards people who wanted to attract atten-\",\"width\":0.8008385529971189,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"x\":0.12159328681548434,\"y\":0.3400651464926816,\"text\":\"tion. He hated dirty jokes.\",\"width\":0.25157232993297274,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.19077570354009604,\"y\":0.31237785013396935,\"text\":\"As a Wah Yan student for five years, Ah Tat had always been a conscientious one.\",\"width\":0.7358490306032455,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.1257861805245011,\"y\":0.29641693802743474,\"text\":\"He iiked chemistry and biology very much. He was among the top boys in class. He liked\",\"width\":0.800838552997119,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.12578618020467192,\"y\":0.2819767445473458,\"text\":\"talking and often made the teachers his butt. He liked helping others in their studies.\",\"width\":0.7714884516661277,\"height\":0.013137261952950063},{\"x\":0.19077570849715808,\"y\":0.252768729401173,\"text\":\"He loved folk songs. He was the vocalist of the folk group called ‘The Turn'who\",\"width\":0.7337525906926152,\"height\":0.014673131141289875},{\"x\":0.12578618947352674,\"y\":0.23680781753688662,\"text\":\"came first in the Talent Time 1969. He was a lover of sports. He liked football and won\",\"width\":0.7987421130864888,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.12578616948327148,\"y\":0.2208469052451123,\"text\":\"the B Grade shot-put and high-jump championships. He also represented the school in\",\"width\":0.800838552997119,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.1254682745054601,\"y\":0.20424841562534746,\"text\":\"many occasions.\",\"width\":0.1598678689348395,\"height\":0.016109897104070736},{\"x\":0.2851153225960603,\"y\":0.20348837188244018,\"text\":\"Once he took part to represent the school in a Judo Tournament against\",\"width\":0.6436058467890111,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"x\":0.12578616601349876,\"y\":0.19040697679687602,\"text\":\"Salesian School.\",\"width\":0.14046121563198202,\"height\":0.011627906774465013},{\"x\":0.1928721396222457,\"y\":0.15988372075598667,\"text\":\"Although Ah Tat had died, those who knew him will remember him as an ordinary\",\"width\":0.7337525906926152,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"x\":0.12578617177020854,\"y\":0.14389534915974878,\"text\":\"young man who had lived a meaningful life.\",\"width\":0.40461215631982006,\"height\":0.013107908043876959},{\"x\":0.1278826001573926,\"y\":0.06540697690346509,\"text\":\"68\",\"width\":0.023060795953558616,\"height\":0.011627906774465013}]",
        "start_char": 0,
        "end_char": 4934
      }
    }
  ],
